WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.140
What it do baby?

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:16.410
This week we bringin down da house with The
Fall of the House of Usher by Edgar Allen Poe. My man.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.620
It’s a dull, dark, and soundless day up
at da House of Usher- where our nameless narrator

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:29.170
just dropped in to see his back-when homeboy
Roderick Usher.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.609
Apparently ol’ Roddy been sick so he sent
da narrator a letter basically sayin: “Dear

00:00:33.609 --> 00:00:35.110
bruh, I’m feelin like shit.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.922
Get yo ass over here and help a brutha out.

00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:38.679
Don’t be a dick.”

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:44.589
Now you’d think anybody would wanna chill
wit’ his boy up in his MANSION- but this

00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:49.829
crib is busted as hell- even got a small crack
runnin from da roof to the flo’.

00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:54.420
Just LOOKIN’ at this fugly shit make da
narrator feel like he got an opium hangover.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:01:00.579
Word is dat Roderick and his sistah Madeline
are the last survivin’ Ushers. and he don’t

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:01.579
count.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:06.700
Anyway, the narrator rolls in to the spot,
peep game at Roderick and be like “Damn,

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.700
son.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.670
You lookin way whiter than usual.”

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.320
Roderick say ”Man I’m straight buggin,
yo.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:16.850
My sister Madeline’s got some bodyillness
and da doctors can’t do shit bout it.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:21.850
Not only dat, but this house is MESSIN wit
my mind, makin’ me all superstitious and

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.500
too scurred to leave da crib.”

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:29.500
So da narrator go in to full on bromode, and
starts paintin’ and readin’ wit him to

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.240
get him to stop mopin’ around like a lil’
bitch.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:35.200
But nuthin’ can break Roddy from dat funk.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.040
Boy start flowin’ bout a king livin’ large
in a PHAT palace.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.110
But when some evil spirits start runnin up
on his crib hauntin the damn place, it go

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.280
from swanky to straight janky.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:50.820
Soon Madeleine stops moving’ and Roderick
like “AWWW shit, she dead man!”

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:55.210
Then fool start gettin’ all paranoid dat
a buncha doctors gonna drop in outta nowhere

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.070
and study her body fo’ science.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:01:59.510
Yeah they will!

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:03.751
Roderick trippin so hard dat he decide he
gonna stash her body in a vault fo’ two

00:02:03.751 --> 00:02:06.410
weeks befo he move her outta da house.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:12.750
So da narrator, bein da realest homie there
is, helps his boy carry his sister’s dead

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:17.230
body and nail her ass in a coffin, and secure
it behind an iron door.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:22.730
Right befo’ he do, he peep Madeline’s
face and be like “Oh shit, this girl smilin!

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:23.890
AND she got rosy cheeks!”

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.440
Aw fuck it, just don’t look at her and keep
on keepin’ on.“

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:32.340
Over the next couple days Roderick mind slippin’
mo’ and mo’- he always lookin’ like

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:36.350
he hearin’ noises and da narrator start
wonderin’ if he hiding something.

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:41.310
A week after they stuffed her in da coffin,
Roddy come bustin’ through da narrator’s

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:45.080
door losin’ his shit over some creepy glowin’
gas round da house.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.380
Da narrator like “Boy calm yo ass down.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.459
Dat’s just somethin’ dat happens.”

00:02:50.459 --> 00:02:55.310
Knowin he gotta get this crazy ass dude to
sleep, da narrator cracks open a book and

00:02:55.310 --> 00:03:00.040
starts reading bout a hard-ass dragonslayer
makin a dragon his bitch.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:06.400
Crazy thing is, tho, errytime a sound is described
in da book, Rod and da narrator hear it echoed

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.410
in da house.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.520
Like when da knight busts in to da dragon’
lair, they hear “cracking and ripping”

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.410
sounds somewhere in da house.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.410
Da hell??

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:18.730
Eventually Roderick completely break down
and start smilin’ and mutterin’ to himself

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.819
like a real creep.

00:03:19.819 --> 00:03:24.040
Dude say he been hearin’ these noises fo’
days and it’s MADELINE who makin’ em...

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.360
“we musta buried her alive man.”

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:29.530
Then all da sudden Roddy like “BREAK YO’SELF
FOOL.

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.459
SHE AT THE DO!”

00:03:31.459 --> 00:03:35.990
And sho’ nuff there Madeleine is, all bloodied
up from bustin out.

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:39.720
Girl collapses on Roderick and they both drop
dead Roderick

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.680
from fear, and her from ya know... gettin
BURIED ALIVE.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:44.680
Da narrator like “Uhhhh...

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.300
Time for me to get my ass outta here” and
straight BOOKS it.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:55.460
As he haulin ass away from da house, he look
back and watch da whole place crumble to da ground.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:02.400
Errybody in da hood know my boy Poe like to
keep it dark.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:07.890
But mo’ than any other famous EAP jams,
Usher perhaps BEST representin’ da “gothic”

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.310
style of lit dat define Poe’s flow.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:16.100
I mean dis story got nasty weather, a creepy
haunted mansion, some mystery sickness, hidden

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:21.760
vaults, medieval decor, and da unnerving sense
dat some WHACKASS Thriller shit bout to go

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:22.760
down.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:26.040
And you know what else makes my nuts shrivel
up?

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.040
TWINS.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.040
CREEPY MAN!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:33.200
And apparently Poe feel me on dat one, cuz
there be doubling all up in this text.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:38.199
Not only are Roderick and his sistah Madeline
twins, but they both pale, skinny as hell,

00:04:38.199 --> 00:04:43.500
and sufferin’ from some shady illnesses
Roderick sick in da mind, while Madeline got

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.060
da funk in her body.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.610
As da story go on, their roles start reversin.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:53.850
At first Madeleine wastin’ away all bedridden
wit’ no control over life.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.020
Roderick gotta be da man of da house.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:00.910
But after they put her ass in da vault, Roderick
start tweakin so hard dat HE da one who gotta

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:01.910
give up control.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:07.710
Shit, he even need one his bruthas to read
him a damn story just so he won’t shit himself.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.750
Madeline, tho- dat girl ain’t playin.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:15.090
She sacks up and BUSTS outta dat coffin even
though it was NAILED DOWN AND sealed with

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.350
an iron door.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.550
This DEAD girl got a superhuman will to LIVE-
ain’t dat some shit?

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:25.560
And as if dat wasn’t real enough, she even
associated with dat hard-ass dragonslayer

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.610
in dat story “Mad Trist.”

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:32.160
While Madeline flexin’ her strength by fightin’
her way out of a stuffy ass coffin afta’

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:37.710
bein left in there for a WEEK, her brotha
Roddy- da man of da house- turns in to whiny

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:38.710
lil’ bitch.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.699
Now dat title got some twin shit goin on too-
cuz it got two meanings.

00:05:42.699 --> 00:05:47.310
On one hand it talkin bout da house dat literally
crumble to shit by da end.

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:50.980
But on da other hand, it’s referring to
da Usher family bloodline.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:55.260
Cuz afta’ Roddy and Madeline’s bodies
get stacked, there ain’t no mo’ Ushers

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.919
on da family tree to carry on da name.

00:05:57.919 --> 00:06:01.830
When it feelin’ like its only a matter of
time befo’ yo life and yo legacy gonna get

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:05.740
fucked, it’s hard not to feel like you trapped
in a bunk ass situation.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:11.020
Matta’ fact, da house’s cramped, claustrophobic
rooms further dem themes of confinement, isolation,

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.020
and loneliness.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:20.520
And to make matters worse, da house cause
errybody in

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:43.060
there go cray in 
the dome and gear up for a 5150-

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:48.949
With da whole world closin in round him, Roderick
feelin’ mad alone.

00:06:48.949 --> 00:06:51.860
So he reach out to da narrator to help a brutha
out.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:55.800
Cuz when da shit gonna hit da fan, it’s
way easier to cope when you got one of yo

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.570
homeboys at yo back.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:04.030
The epigraph reppin dat same idea:

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:08.540
Yo thanks for watching, man! Peace!

